    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) announced the results of its supplementary SSC examinations on August 30, 2008. Students, who took the supplementary examinations, have been provided their final verified college entry marks in the college enrolment season and will not lose any time in starting their higher secondary studies.",
